   "line": 1666,
   "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
   "context": "ship:Diaspersi",
   "english": "The Diaspersi-class Escort Carrier is a light carrier capable of providing carrier operations support to smaller fleets, while also being capable of independent strike missions with minimal support. Seen escorting large merchant convoys and small Guard fleets alike, the Diaspersi can support two wings of combat drones as well as a single wing of larger fighters.",
   "delimiter": "quote",
   "leading_tab": false,
   "raw": "\tdescription \"The Diaspersi-class Escort Carrier is a light carrier capable of providing carrier operations support to smaller fleets, while also being capable of independent strike missions with minimal support. Seen escorting large merchant convoys and small Guard fleets alike, the Diaspersi can support two wings of combat drones as well as a single wing of larger fighters.\"",
   "english_hash": "c25f54b9691963e6"
  },
