  {
   "idx": 18,
   "id": "ship:Refraktos|description|1830|0",
   "path": "data/avgi/avgi ships.txt",
   "line": 1830,
   "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
   "context": "ship:Refraktos",
   "english": "The Refraktos-class Laserstar is a relatively recent, post-Diaspora destroyer design with a single focus: directed energy weapons. While its armor and shielding systems are light for its size, its expansive radiators can support the thermal loads of a staggering array of laser weapons, both offensive and defensive, allowing it to destroy both missiles and small ships from a vast distance.",
   "delimiter": "quote",
   "leading_tab": false,
   "raw": "\tdescription \"The Refraktos-class Laserstar is a relatively recent, post-Diaspora destroyer design with a single focus: directed energy weapons. While its armor and shielding systems are light for its size, its expansive radiators can support the thermal loads of a staggering array of laser weapons, both offensive and defensive, allowing it to destroy both missiles and small ships from a vast distance.\"",
   "english_hash": "e955b15860fd24f6"
  },
  {
   "idx": 19,
   "id": "ship:Refraktos|description|1831|0",
   "path": "data/avgi/avgi ships.txt",
   "line": 1831,
   "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
   "context": "ship:Refraktos",
   "english": "\tA long truss running the length of the ship is built to fit an impressively large mirror-cell fusion torch, giving the Refraktos the mobility needed to evade opponents until they are reduced to hot vapor.",
   "delimiter": "quote",
   "leading_tab": true,
   "raw": "\tdescription \"\tA long truss running the length of the ship is built to fit an impressively large mirror-cell fusion torch, giving the Refraktos the mobility needed to evade opponents until they are reduced to hot vapor.\"",
   "english_hash": "4aa378a844be2afd"
  },
  {
   "idx": 20,
   "id": "ship:Refraktos|description|1832|0",
   "path": "data/avgi/avgi ships.txt",
   "line": 1832,
   "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
   "context": "ship:Refraktos",
   "english": "\tDue to the anemic damage output of Avgi laser weapons compared to their kinetic weapons and missiles, the Refraktos is most often seen in a support role, providing antimissile coverage to entire fleets.",
   "delimiter": "quote",
   "leading_tab": true,
   "raw": "\tdescription \"\tDue to the anemic damage output of Avgi laser weapons compared to their kinetic weapons and missiles, the Refraktos is most often seen in a support role, providing antimissile coverage to entire fleets.\"",
   "english_hash": "2f408de05dbef43b"
  },
