   "kind": "DESCRIPTION",
   "context": "ship:Atenuatia",
   "english": "The Atenuatia is an Avgi fleet carrier, a capital ship that makes up the centerpiece of their battlefleets. With six wings of combat drones and two wings of bombers, an Atenuatia can bring forth an astounding amount of firepower. Carrying this arsenal of fighters has its cost, however, and the Atenuatia can carry relatively few heavy weapons for its size.",
   "delimiter": "quote",
   "leading_tab": false,
   "raw": "\tdescription \"The Atenuatia is an Avgi fleet carrier, a capital ship that makes up the centerpiece of their battlefleets. With six wings of combat drones and two wings of bombers, an Atenuatia can bring forth an astounding amount of firepower. Carrying this arsenal of fighters has its cost, however, and the Atenuatia can carry relatively few heavy weapons for its size.\"",
